Changes made by Asciiverse (2026): the entries' sources are compiled as
the IOCCC publishes them (taken from github.com/ioccc-src/winner at
commit 9142d5f, 2026-10-07), but each is built as a function inside a
launcher of ours, launcher/, which runs it in a child process: the
fluid simulator gets its scenes on its input and its picture is read
back, centred in the terminal; chaos gets its data files from the
program itself and its keys from the launcher, which turns the object,
and its curses picture is drawn centred. The launcher plays the scenes
and objects in turn, quits on any key and puts the terminal back.
PATCHES.md lists every change. The launcher and the rest of this
packaging are copyright (c) 2026 Asciiverse and, as adaptations of the
entries, are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

